      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_18",
      "hash64": "B98EBA6E5775C0DE",
      "text": "¡Te felicito! Has completado la pista Nieve Polvo\\npor primera vez. Aquí tienes tu premio.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_24",
      "hash64": "B98B486E5772C951",
      "text": "¡La próxima vez puedes ponerte a prueba en la\\npista Ventisca, que es algo más difícil!\\c\\n¡Venga, agur!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_19",
      "hash64": "B98EBB6E5775C291",
      "text": "¡Felicidades por completar la pista Ventisca\\npor primera vez! ¡Lo has hecho de miedo!\\c\\nAquí tienes tu bien merecido premio.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_25",
      "hash64": "B98B476E5772C79E",
      "text": "¡La próxima vez puedes ponerte a prueba en la\\npista Frío Polar, la más difícil de todas!\\c\\nVuelve si te atreves con ella. ¡Venga, agur!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_20",
      "hash64": "B98B4C6E5772D01D",
      "text": "¡Lo veo y no lo creo! ¡Has completado la pista\\nFrío Polar por primera vez!\\c\\nTenemos a un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a maestr[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa del eslalon gigante ante\\nnosotros. Toma este premio, te lo has ganado.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_21",
      "hash64": "B98B4B6E5772CE6A",
      "text": "¡Has batido tu propia plusmarca!\\nHa sido un descenso digno de ver.\\c\\nToma esto para celebrarlo.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_22",
      "hash64": "B98B4A6E5772CCB7",
      "text": "Has llegado a la meta de una pieza.\\n¡Bien hecho!\\c\\nAquí tienes, por tus esfuerzos.\\n¡Intenta aspirar aún más alto la próxima vez!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
